  "embedding_model": "BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5",
  "circularity_note": "Gold is skill tag membership; tags and chunk text come from one synthetic generator and the chunk text repeats the tags, so lexical rankers have an easy path. Larger leak: decompose() reads the literal 'Required: a, b, c.' marker that the generator writes into every job, and that list IS the gold skill list. V1, V3 and V8 therefore partly read the answer key. The ablation runner adds a no_marker row (decomposition by plain sentence and comma splitting) as the honest test of the decomposition hypothesis.",
  "chunking_note": "Portfolio items are about 30 words and chunk_words is 60, so every item is a single chunk: fixed-size chunking is implemented but not exercised by this corpus.",
  "rerank_note": "Reranker scores are memoised per (query, passage) within a variant run, so p95 latency reflects warm repeats of requirement strings across jobs.",
  "recall_note": "recall@5 = hits in top 5 / gold size; with gold larger than 5 the maximum is below 1. recall@5_capped divides by min(gold size, 5). coverage@5 = share of coverable required skills with a tagged item in the top 5.",
  "latency_note": "wall clock per search on this laptop CPU, cold query cache per variant",
  "v8_corrective_stats": {
   "corrective_rewrites": 432,
   "corrective_queries": 121
  }
